    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MISS WOLLSTEN: If you'll forgive me...I've letters to write.\nCATHY: I've just been admiring Thea's headdress. I think I shall have a hat made like it a little round cap with a veil ——",
      "CATHY: She's in her room.\nTHEA: I'll get her --",
      "THEA: You should sleep, Cathy. Lie down and close your eyes. Try to forget everything.\nCATHY: When I close my eyes, I see Miss Wollsten. I can't think of anything else.\nTHEA: She is dead — at peace.\nCATHY: Suppose, she isn't dead. Suppose it was a cataleptic attack?",
      "THEA: Cathy?\nMISS WOLLSTEN: Cathy!"
    ]
  },
